-- ============================================================
-- reforge_plus3_mods.sql
--
-- Auto-generated by tools/balance/generate_plus3_mods.py.
-- Populates item_mods for Reforge +3 items that shipped from
-- upstream LSB with empty/near-empty mod blocks.
--
-- Strategy: read each empty +3 item's corresponding +2 stats,
-- apply the PLUS3_STEP delta table (derived from the user's
-- already-healthy AF+3 designs, median of 110 sample pairs),
-- and emit the resulting (itemId, modId, value) rows.
--
-- Uses INSERT ... ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE so that:
--   - re-running the SQL is safe (UPDATEs existing rows in place);
--   - existing job-specific token mods on near-empty +3 items
--     (e.g., lanun_tricorne_+3 mod 542, agoge_lorica_+3 mod 955)
--     are PRESERVED, because we only touch mods that also exist
--     on the corresponding +2. No DELETE is performed.
--
-- To apply:
--   mysql -u root -p your_db_name < modules/custom/sql/reforge_plus3_mods.sql
--
-- After applying, restart the map server (item templates are
-- read at boot) and re-run tools/balance/gear_coverage.py to
-- verify the +3 rows now score above zero.
-- ============================================================

